<title>AUSTRIA: Klima sees CA sale soon after Jan 10.</title>
<headline>Klima sees CA sale soon after Jan 10.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Finance Minister Viktor Klima said on Tuesday he would make a decision on the sale of privatisation candidate Creditanstalt-Bankverein &quot;as soon as possible&quot; after a January 10 deadline for updated bids expires.</p>
<p>&quot;It will happen as soon as possible,&quot; he told reporters. He declined to be pinned down on an exact date for the decision, but added: &quot;I take it for granted that it won't take ten days.&quot;</p>
</text>
